@startuml
actor User

interface Car {
    +numberPlate: String
}

class Wheel {
    +diameter: Float
}

class Engine {
    +power: Int
}

class Seats {
    +size: Int
}

class Model {
    -name: String
    +wheels: List[Wheel]
    +engine: Engine
    +seats: Seats
}

class Make {
    -name: String
    +models: List[Model]
}

class Car {
    -model: Model
    +make: Make
    +numberPlate: String
    +wheels: List[Wheel]
    +engine: Engine
    +seats: Seats
}

User -> Car : create a car
Car --> Wheel : has four wheels
Car --> Engine : has one engine
Car --> Seats : has seats of the same size for all cars in the model

Make --> Model : contains multiple models
Model --> Wheel : each wheel must have the same diameter for all wheels of the same car
Model --> Engine : each engine must have a certain power
Model --> Seats : each seat must have a certain size for all seats of the same model

Car --> Make : belongs to a make
Car --> Model : belongs to a model
@enduml